<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/4th-century">4th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">357 CE</h1><p class="ref-lede">357 CE in world history: 3 events, 2 deaths and 1 work. 143 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
